    - PATCH merges unknown JSON, purifies, stamps current attribution and commits before local notifications
    - PUT replaces on match and creates on miss using the exact branch grant and shipping response headers
    - PATCH and PUT preserve missing, deleted, read-only, immutable and conditional responses without mutation
