    - each mutation needs the exact current subject name; outages are 503 and root invents no subject
    - refuses only marked nonrepresentable submissions as 400, preserving storage/internal failures as 500
    - rolls back each actual mutation before commit with no row changes or committed notifications
    - configured retention following PATCH uses operator policy, not an invented uploader delete grant
    - pages fully tied entries exactly once in the independent stored identity order for both tenants

